SUMMARY:20s & 30s Hike at Mt. Kearsarge (South)
LOCATION:Lincoln Trail\, 122-198 Kearsarge Valley R\nWarner\, NH
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 22\, 2025\nhttps://activities.outdoors.org
 /s/oc-activity/a5UUN000001tTTp2AM/\nJoin the Worcester 20s & 30s group for
  a hike of Mt. Kearsarge (South) in Warner\, NH on Saturday\, November 22n
 d! This hike will be just under 10 miles and around 2\,500 ft elevation ga
 in. Our intention is to go at a roughly a 1.5 mile per hour pace. Expect t
 o be on trail for the full day.Mt. Kearsarge is part of NH's 52 with-a-vie
 w list. On a clear day\, you can see the Boston skyline as well as a 360-d
 egree view!Sturdy shoes with laces\, at least 2 liters of water\, snacks/l
 unch\, and appropriate layers of clothing are required. Participants shoul
 d be prepared for winter conditions and will likely be requested to bring 
 microspikes in case of ice at higher elevations. No dogs\, please. Further
  details\, such as start time and location\, will be provided to participa
 nts after they complete the required screening form\, which will be sent a
 fter registering. Hope to have you join us!
